00:01:35.090 --> 00:01:35.923
- [Interviewer] So, what are the three

00:01:35.923 --> 00:01:37.130
most important things to keep in mind

00:01:37.130 --> 00:01:38.320
for someone who wants to build a

00:01:38.320 --> 00:01:40.630
public face and personal
brand in your mind?

00:01:40.630 --> 00:01:42.413
- Number one, you better be a good person.

00:01:42.413 --> 00:01:44.750
You better recognize that
if you have skeletons,

00:01:44.750 --> 00:01:46.510
you better own them, or know that

00:01:46.510 --> 00:01:47.910
they're going to be vulnerable.

00:01:47.910 --> 00:01:49.001
Because that game has

00:01:49.001 --> 00:01:51.280
that ship has sailed.

00:01:51.280 --> 00:01:53.230
Something I started talking about in 2008.

00:01:53.230 --> 00:01:55.190
In Crush It, it obviously is now

00:01:55.190 --> 00:01:57.430
very real 'cause of all
the stuff that's happened

00:01:57.430 --> 00:01:59.630
with the Me Too movement
which is phenomenal.

00:01:59.630 --> 00:02:00.470
That's number one.

00:02:00.470 --> 00:02:01.330
Number two,

00:02:02.490 --> 00:02:04.640
you have to have empathy
for your audience.

00:02:04.640 --> 00:02:05.790
If you're the kind of person

00:02:05.790 --> 00:02:09.050
that gets upset that johnnypants99

00:02:09.050 --> 00:02:10.870
says you're ugly or you're stupid,

00:02:10.870 --> 00:02:13.270
you might as well close up shop now.

00:02:13.270 --> 00:02:15.000
I have empathy for people that think I'm a

00:02:15.000 --> 00:02:17.320
snake oil salesman or
full of crap or not good

00:02:17.320 --> 00:02:18.153
or who knows?

00:02:18.153 --> 00:02:20.040
Or I curse too much.

00:02:20.040 --> 00:02:21.530
You have to have empathy,

00:02:21.530 --> 00:02:23.600
because that's what
allows you to move forward

00:02:23.600 --> 00:02:25.900
instead of being combative
with the audience

00:02:25.900 --> 00:02:27.800
which is your ultimate asset.

00:02:27.800 --> 00:02:30.240
Number three, you have to respect context.

00:02:30.240 --> 00:02:32.700
The same picture does not work across

00:02:32.700 --> 00:02:34.800
Facebook, Instagram, Pinterest, Snapchat.

00:02:34.800 --> 00:02:36.430
And you have to have understanding of the

00:02:36.430 --> 00:02:39.010
context of the psychology of the person

00:02:39.010 --> 00:02:40.580
when they're on that platform

00:02:40.580 --> 00:02:43.070
to make the content pop and resonate.

00:02:43.070 --> 00:02:45.670
So, the religion of context,

00:02:45.670 --> 00:02:48.320
not just content, is essential.

00:02:48.320 --> 00:02:51.562
The single biggest
reason I maintain Gary V

00:02:51.562 --> 00:02:53.048
is to be a doer.

00:02:53.048 --> 00:02:54.070
- Right.

00:02:55.080 --> 00:02:57.230
- I mean to me my personal brand is about

00:02:57.230 --> 00:02:58.940
top of the funnel awareness,

00:02:58.940 --> 00:03:01.440
but way more importantly,
I'm a practitioner.

00:03:01.440 --> 00:03:02.810
I post on Instagram.

00:03:04.020 --> 00:03:05.470
I reply to DM's.

00:03:05.470 --> 00:03:06.360
- You get it, you got it.

00:03:06.360 --> 00:03:07.193
- I have to,

00:03:07.193 --> 00:03:09.440
listen, you have to
know what you're doing.

00:03:09.440 --> 00:03:10.680
What's some advice you
would give to somebody

00:03:10.680 --> 00:03:13.260
that just doesn't know what
they want to do, right now?

00:03:13.260 --> 00:03:14.800
- Just speak your truth, right?

00:03:14.800 --> 00:03:15.870
Speak your truth.

00:03:15.870 --> 00:03:18.570
Including that you have depression

00:03:18.570 --> 00:03:20.270
or that you don't know what you're doing

00:03:20.270 --> 00:03:22.860
or that you're really good at cutting hair

00:03:22.860 --> 00:03:25.800
or that you love The Smurfs.

00:03:25.800 --> 00:03:29.514
I think the truth is
the biggest win, right?

00:03:29.514 --> 00:03:31.743
And I think that for me,

00:03:31.743 --> 00:03:34.590
that has really played
out in our society today.

00:03:34.590 --> 00:03:35.890
There's no more hiding.

00:03:35.890 --> 00:03:37.670
The internet is all encompassing.

00:03:37.670 --> 00:03:40.470
And nobody's gonna be able to front.

00:03:40.470 --> 00:03:43.231
Like, if you're not
motivated and optimistic,

00:03:43.231 --> 00:03:46.400
motivational content's
not going to work for you.

00:03:46.400 --> 00:03:48.760
You know, if you aren't
thoughtful and smart

00:03:48.760 --> 00:03:52.660
about sports, you're not gonna win.

00:03:52.660 --> 00:03:54.320
You can only win on two things,

00:03:54.320 --> 00:03:56.750
the thing that you understand the best,

00:03:56.750 --> 00:03:58.560
or the thing that you're most passionate

00:03:58.560 --> 00:03:59.900
or authentic about.

00:03:59.900 --> 00:04:01.874
Those are the only two winning formulas.

00:04:01.874 --> 00:04:03.990
I think too many people want to

00:04:03.990 --> 00:04:05.390
fake it 'til they make it,

00:04:05.390 --> 00:04:08.010
or project someone they're not.

00:04:08.010 --> 00:04:09.990
Which is why 99 percent
of people are losing.

