When I'm driving, it's better for me

00:04:46.230 --> 00:04:47.430
to listen or commute.

00:04:47.430 --> 00:04:49.320
So to me, I care about communication.

00:04:49.320 --> 00:04:50.420
I'm not as

00:04:50.420 --> 00:04:53.230
I'm not bright enough or as smart as

00:04:53.230 --> 00:04:55.150
my partner in crime here

00:04:55.150 --> 00:04:57.180
