00:20:15.145 --> 00:20:15.978
- Yeah.

00:20:16.850 --> 00:20:17.891
- Is it really bad?

00:20:17.891 --> 00:20:18.760
- Yeah it's kinda bad.

00:20:18.760 --> 00:20:20.016
- Somebody died?

00:20:20.016 --> 00:20:21.570
- Well, my grandma's in the hospital and

00:20:21.570 --> 00:20:23.144
my girlfriend broke up with me and

00:20:23.144 --> 00:20:25.757
- Dude, you just need a couple weeks.

00:20:25.757 --> 00:20:26.960
Let me tell you something,

00:20:26.960 --> 00:20:28.620
you're so young, you can't judge your life

00:20:28.620 --> 00:20:30.310
based on two weeks.

00:20:30.310 --> 00:20:31.880
You could be in a slump for three months

00:20:31.880 --> 00:20:33.680
but then in four months, you're back.

00:20:33.680 --> 00:20:35.500
Don't judge yourself
for not being productive

00:20:35.500 --> 00:20:36.950
while you're being emotional.

00:20:38.191 --> 00:20:40.360
Put it into perspective.

00:20:40.360 --> 00:20:41.680
It's fuckin' two weeks,

00:20:41.680 --> 00:20:43.490
three months out of your entire life.

00:20:43.490 --> 00:20:44.390
Doesn't mean shit!

00:20:45.429 --> 00:20:47.060
You're gonna get a better girlfriend.

00:20:47.060 --> 00:20:48.980
You're gonna like it better.

00:20:48.980 --> 00:20:50.090
- Very first book from you.

00:20:50.090 --> 00:20:50.923
- A classic!

00:20:50.923 --> 00:20:51.756
- Yes!

00:20:54.090 --> 00:20:54.923
- Iris,

00:20:54.923 --> 00:20:56.859
you were like 13 when this shit came out!

00:20:56.859 --> 00:20:57.970
(laughs)

00:20:57.970 --> 00:21:00.610
- Question, for someone who
grew up with a hard childhood,

00:21:00.610 --> 00:21:01.860
how do they overcome that?

00:21:01.860 --> 00:21:04.200
- [Gary] By yelling out loud

00:21:04.200 --> 00:21:05.770
the poison that was.

00:21:05.770 --> 00:21:06.830
- Okay, other question

00:21:06.830 --> 00:21:08.160
- The way you own it

00:21:08.160 --> 00:21:09.510
is by putting it out there.

00:21:10.803 --> 00:21:11.636
- Alright.

00:21:11.636 --> 00:21:14.342
- It's owning you because of its secrets.

00:21:14.342 --> 00:21:15.617
- Alright.

00:21:15.617 --> 00:21:16.490
Thanks man.

00:21:16.490 --> 00:21:17.323
- You understand?

00:21:17.323 --> 00:21:18.156
- Yeah.

00:21:18.156 --> 00:21:19.370
- Once you put it out, it's over.

00:21:19.370 --> 00:21:22.430
Look, this entire evening
is why I'm emotional.

00:21:22.430 --> 00:21:26.040
You guys, so many of you
are keeping a secret inside

00:21:26.040 --> 00:21:28.760
that's just insecurities
that your mom gave you

00:21:28.760 --> 00:21:31.560
or your dad gave you or
your older sibling gave you.

00:21:31.560 --> 00:21:33.010
A lot of you are sitting with them.

00:21:33.010 --> 00:21:34.740
Half of you are sitting with them.

00:21:34.740 --> 00:21:35.829
I met you tonight.

00:21:35.829 --> 00:21:38.645
The fact that I know that if
you made a video right now

00:21:38.645 --> 00:21:40.430
and just told your truth,

00:21:40.430 --> 00:21:43.610
if you did, if you did, if you did

00:21:43.610 --> 00:21:45.270
if you just took fuckin'
Instagram right now,

00:21:45.270 --> 00:21:47.420
flipped it, and said it,

00:21:47.420 --> 00:21:49.640
it would change your fuckin' life.

00:21:49.640 --> 00:21:51.834
Your poison is your secret.

00:21:51.834 --> 00:21:56.550
You can't imagine what
your secret's doing to you.

00:21:56.550 --> 00:21:58.660
You want a little Airport Gary, Iris?

00:21:58.660 --> 00:21:59.730
- [Iris] Yeah.

00:21:59.730 --> 00:22:01.371
- I mean it's only half
Airport Gary, Iris.

00:22:01.371 --> 00:22:04.040
But, I already got the beanie but I can

00:22:04.040 --> 00:22:05.835
