00:22:05.835 --> 00:22:07.190
- [Iris] I have your other one.

00:22:07.190 --> 00:22:08.870
- I, it's okay.

00:22:13.060 --> 00:22:14.889
Iris, I'm gonna give it to you.

00:22:14.889 --> 00:22:16.330
Here we go.

00:22:16.330 --> 00:22:17.163
One.

00:22:21.861 --> 00:22:22.694
Number one.

00:22:22.694 --> 00:22:24.580
Guys, fuckin' intensity.

00:22:24.580 --> 00:22:28.920
Toronto, I fuckin' love
your city so fuckin' much.

00:22:28.920 --> 00:22:31.848
I just, love this fuckin' city.

00:22:31.848 --> 00:22:34.420
And I just want everybody to know,

00:22:34.420 --> 00:22:36.530
